 371:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to Check whether global interrupts are enabled on the CPU.
 372:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 373:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API provides the status of CPU where this API is called.
 374:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 375:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \return Status of global interrupt enable bit.
 376:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 377:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval TRUE:  Global interrupts enabled.
 378:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *		   FALSE: Global interrupts disabled.
