 389:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval TRUE:  Previously, global interrupts enabled.
 390:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *		   FALSE: Previously, global interrupts disabled.
