 573:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief Reset and starts the instruction, clock and multi counters of the CPU
 574:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * Reset and start CCNT, ICNT, M1CNT, M2CNT, M3CNT. the overflow bits are cleared.
 575:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 576:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] mode Counter mode. Range: \ref IfxCpu_CounterMode.
